&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you interested in challenging projects, technical innovation, implementing new ideas and solving complex problems?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our software,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;, is an ERP software for finance, leasing, fleet and mobility management in the automotive industry. It is a complex end-to-end solution that includes front, mid and back office functions and can be extensively customized to the customer&#39;s needs through configuration. Our customers are leasing and financing companies from the automotive industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Implementation Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be part of a dynamic multidisciplinary unit and play a key role in creating, configuring, and assembling the foundational components of Sofico’s solution to support and enhance business processes. By collaborating closely with clients and project teams, you will design, implement, and deliver tailored solutions that meet the customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and refine customer requirements into detailed functional and system specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess existing Miles functionality and propose effective solution directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, execute and document configuration solution designs in collaboration with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct unit testing to ensure quality and reliability of configured solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely delivery and successful handover of solutions to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data migration, document management, and reporting from an in-depth understanding of customer solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Managers to align project solutions with the product’s roadmap and future developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior consultants and contribute to best practices and knowledge sharing across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead workshops and customer engagements to drive solution adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You like to work on impactful projects in a dynamic and innovative environment, and are driven by collaboration with passionate professionals and contributing to delivering solutions that drive customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What else is expected:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;configuration or implementation consulting role&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in a tech-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;software implementation lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;system configuration, testing, and documentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;leading projects or mentoring team members&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would like to welcome you to an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;international and multicultural company&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that has been operating for over 30 years and is doubling in size every 5 years. Growth is our middle name, while we strongly adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;horizontal and open company culture&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re in the drivers&#39; seat of your own career, that&#39;s our motto. Your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;personal development&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is therefore paramount. During an extensive&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;onboarding program&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of six months, we make you, with the support of your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;job coach&lt;/strong&gt;, familiar with our product and the organization. Even after this period, you will continue to get opportunities to learn and develop yourself further. You’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;never alone&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico you will also work in a modern state-of-the-art office that is easily&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;accessible&lt;/strong&gt;. We have plenty of safe charging points for your electric car.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In return for your efforts, we offer an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;extensive salary package&lt;/strong&gt;, including a company car, pension scheme and medical insurance. The &lt;strong&gt;flexible office hours&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;hybrid working policy&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;provide the necessary flexibility within the company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico we are strong believers in the power of a good cup of coffee. Water or soft drinks are of course also on the menu. We love our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;team events&lt;/strong&gt;. Think after-work drinks, a BBQ, a family day, a company weekend, or a walking dinner with the whole company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

