&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;c0f7li&quot; data-start=&quot;204&quot; data-end=&quot;250&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;206&quot; data-end=&quot;248&quot;&gt;Head of Product &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Hamburg, Germany (with regular travel in Europe and to the US) &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to&lt;/strong&gt;: Founders (Dr. Jury Schewel &amp;amp; Dr. Dimitry Schewel)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Competitive salary + meaningful equity participation &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;946xbe&quot; data-start=&quot;436&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;468&quot;&gt;About the Venture – ROB’E&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;ROB’E is an early-stage MedTech venture developing an AI-powered robotic platform for echocardiography. The technology aims to transform cardiac imaging and enable more precise, image-guided structural heart interventions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;695&quot; data-end=&quot;914&quot;&gt;The company was founded by Dr. Jury Schewel and Dr. Dimitry Schewel, both cardiologists and clinical leaders at Marienkrankenhaus Hamburg. ROB’E is part of the venture portfolio of &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;NLC Health Ventures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;977&quot;&gt;The company has already achieved key milestones, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6sxr75&quot; data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1026&quot;&gt;First-in-human use of its robotic TEE system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;197v1wy&quot; data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1082&quot;&gt;Strategic partnership with a leading imaging player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hoe7fv&quot; data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;Strong clinical collaborations and scientific validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;ROB’E is now entering a critical phase of product development, clinical validation, and fundraising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1omw3ut&quot; data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1255&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial and highly driven leader to join ROB’E as &lt;strong&gt;Head of Product &amp;amp; Strategy. &lt;/strong&gt;This role is ideal for someone who wants to take a breakthrough medical technology from early clinical proof-of-concept to a globally scalable company.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with the founders and take increasing responsibility for strategy, product development, fundraising, and business building.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1709&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;w0596o&quot; data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1rct0va&quot; data-start=&quot;1732&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;Drive Strategy &amp;amp; Company Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xy26um&quot; data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1855&quot;&gt;Shape the overall company strategy, business model, and go-to-market approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5o6zzy&quot; data-start=&quot;1856&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Conduct market, customer, and competitive analyses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aebxo1&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;Develop commercialization strategies for Europe and the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ac1e7m&quot; data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1979&quot; data-end=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;Lead Product Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2008&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18gmqsa&quot; data-start=&quot;2008&quot; data-end=&quot;2068&quot;&gt;Translate clinical needs into clear product requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d01b6v&quot; data-start=&quot;2069&quot; data-end=&quot;2138&quot;&gt;Drive development toward &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;design freeze&lt;/strong&gt; and product-market fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1oui0rg&quot; data-start=&quot;2139&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;Ensure execution against milestones, timelines, and budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1uv3xfg&quot; data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2207&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;Advance Clinical &amp;amp; Regulatory Pathways&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2442&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qfpbpk&quot; data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2306&quot;&gt;Coordinate clinical validation and usability studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ba236r&quot; data-start=&quot;2307&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;Support regulatory strategy toward CE marking and FDA approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12lnnqz&quot; data-start=&quot;2374&quot; data-end=&quot;2442&quot;&gt;Build and maintain relationships with clinical partners and KOLs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;wsz54f&quot; data-start=&quot;2444&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2448&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;Fundraising &amp;amp; Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2479&quot; data-end=&quot;2660&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ztni8m&quot; data-start=&quot;2479&quot; data-end=&quot;2543&quot;&gt;Prepare investor materials and support fundraising processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;66y462&quot; data-start=&quot;2544&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;Engage with investors, strategic partners, and grant providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14pdm3t&quot; data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2660&quot;&gt;Strengthen partnerships with industry leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1uzwfvw&quot; data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2700&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2666&quot; data-end=&quot;2700&quot;&gt;Build &amp;amp; Scale the Organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2701&quot; data-end=&quot;2858&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16j3y6s&quot; data-start=&quot;2701&quot; data-end=&quot;2739&quot;&gt;Support hiring of key team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l0u808&quot; data-start=&quot;2740&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;Establish KPIs, processes, and reporting structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12t0etb&quot; data-start=&quot;2796&quot; data-end=&quot;2858&quot;&gt;Contribute to a high-performance, execution-driven culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2860&quot; data-end=&quot;2863&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;e50tfj&quot; data-start=&quot;2865&quot; data-end=&quot;2884&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2868&quot; data-end=&quot;2884&quot;&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2886&quot; data-end=&quot;2976&quot;&gt;You combine strategic thinking with strong execution and are motivated to build a company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;6l4sas&quot; data-start=&quot;2978&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2982&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3287&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v2ttr4&quot; data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;Is entrepreneurial, hands-on, and driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2xh95s&quot; data-start=&quot;3063&quot; data-end=&quot;3112&quot;&gt;Thrives in fast-paced, ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;addr2x&quot; data-start=&quot;3113&quot; data-end=&quot;3169&quot;&gt;Can bridge clinical, technical, and business domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qihxif&quot; data-start=&quot;3170&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;Communicates effectively with investors, clinicians, and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;om770v&quot; data-start=&quot;3241&quot; data-end=&quot;3287&quot;&gt;Is passionate about improving patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;h3s27h&quot; data-start=&quot;3289&quot; data-end=&quot;3317&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3293&quot; data-end=&quot;3317&quot;&gt;Preferred Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3318&quot; data-end=&quot;3748&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ezenti&quot; data-start=&quot;3318&quot; data-end=&quot;3391&quot;&gt;5–15+ years of experience in MedTech, HealthTech, or medical robotics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vfj2xc&quot; data-start=&quot;3392&quot; data-end=&quot;3451&quot;&gt;Experience in product development and commercialization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r479j&quot; data-start=&quot;3452&quot; data-end=&quot;3513&quot;&gt;Familiarity with medical device development (Class I–III)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n3bepv&quot; data-start=&quot;3514&quot; data-end=&quot;3580&quot;&gt;Exposure to clinical studies and regulatory processes (CE/FDA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5a65y6&quot; data-start=&quot;3581&quot; data-end=&quot;3637&quot;&gt;Experience with fundraising or investor interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rcpeeg&quot; data-start=&quot;3638&quot; data-end=&quot;3707&quot;&gt;Background in imaging, robotics, or cardiovascular care is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gaespb&quot; data-start=&quot;3708&quot; data-end=&quot;3748&quot;&gt;Fluent in English (German is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3750&quot; data-end=&quot;3753&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1pw1999&quot; data-start=&quot;3755&quot; data-end=&quot;3777&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3758&quot; data-end=&quot;3777&quot;&gt;Why Join ROB’E?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3778&quot; data-end=&quot;4091&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tdwgj1&quot; data-start=&quot;3778&quot; data-end=&quot;3847&quot;&gt;Build a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3788&quot; data-end=&quot;3825&quot;&gt;category-defining MedTech company&lt;/strong&gt; from an early stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wf7lvs&quot; data-start=&quot;3848&quot; data-end=&quot;3901&quot;&gt;Work directly with experienced physician-founders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tgz6th&quot; data-start=&quot;3902&quot; data-end=&quot;3967&quot;&gt;Take ownership across strategy, product, and company building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wnya8e&quot; data-start=&quot;3968&quot; data-end=&quot;4029&quot;&gt;Gain exposure to leading investors and strategic partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We would love to hear from exceptional individuals who are excited about building a company at the intersection of AI, robotics, and cardiovascular medicine.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4093&quot; data-end=&quot;4096&quot;&gt;
